    "enUS": {
      "description": "We must determine the source and nature of the poison corrupting this land. Let us begin with the groundwater under the farms in the area.\r\n\r\nGo to the Jansen Stead in the north and the Molsen Farm northwest of here, and collect samples from the wells there.",
      "dialogue": {
        "248c3f9650bffaa54e38": "We must determine the source and nature of the poison corrupting this land. Let us begin with the groundwater under the farms in the area.\n\nGo to the Jansen Stead in the north and the Molsen Farm northwest of here, and collect samples from the wells there.",
        "9dc110597ebafb36a34e": "Did you collect the samples?",
        "d76a2e8d6344617e9a10": "Thank you. Let me see..."
      },
      "summary": "Use the Well Water Sample Kit to collect samples from the wells at the Jansen Stead and the Molsen Farm.",
      "title": "Testing the Wells",
